.include /home/solomon/code/oresat/oresat-rw-board-rev8/.claude/worktrees/bus-ring-sim/sims/bus-ring/models/lmg2100r044.lib
* device port: current sense into the VIN pin, optional pad-gap L
VIVIN devC_V vs1 0
RPAD vs1 vinp 1u
XU12 vinp sw 0 hb hs hi li vcc agnd LMG2100R044 PARAMS: TJ=25
* driver ground: GND pin 15 to PGND through the board GND return (estimate)
LAGND agnd 0 2n
* VCC: +5V -> R36 2.7 ohm -> VCC pin; bootstrap C73 100 nF + R37 2.7 ohm to HS
V5 v5 0 5
CV5 v5 0 1u
R36 v5 vcc 2.7
C73 hb bst 100n
R37 bst hs 2.7
* MCU inputs through 22 ohm + 47 pF (R34/C72, R35/C70)
VHIS his 0 PWL(0 0 2.604167e-06 0 2.605167e-06 3.3 7.812500e-06 3.3 7.813500e-06 0 1.302083e-05 0 1.302183e-05 3.3 1.822917e-05 3.3 1.823017e-05 0)
R34 his hi 22
C72 hi 0 47p
VLIS lis 0 PWL(0 0 5e-9 0 6e-9 3.3 2.593767e-06 3.3 2.594767e-06 0 7.822900e-06 0 7.823900e-06 3.3 1.301043e-05 3.3 1.301143e-05 0 1.823957e-05 0 1.824057e-05 3.3)
R35 lis li 22
C70 li 0 47p
* phase: R39 2 mOhm shunt, 100 uH, back-EMF source at duty*Vbus; IPRE hands i0 to the bridge at 100-110 ns, LS already on
R39 sw swl 2m
LLOAD swl vmid 0.0001
VMID vmid 0 3.8
IPRE vmid swl PWL(0 5 100n 5 110n 0)
* BDF2: trap rings and diverges on the stiff Murata ladders; Gear above order 2 is not A-stable and stalls
.options timeint method=gear maxord=2
.options nonlin-tran maxstep=100
.tran 0.02n 2.083333e-05 0 0.1n
.print tran format=csv v(sw) i(VIVIN) v(devC_V) i(VFS) i(LLOAD) {v(hb)-v(hs)} v(hi) v(li)
.end